category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libsasl2-devel libsnappy-devel libssl-devel libutf8proc-devel libzstd-devel zlib-devel
sdesc: "High-performance MongoDB driver for C (utilities)"
ldesc: "The MongoDB C Driver, also known as “libmongoc”, is a library for using
MongoDB from C applications, and for writing MongoDB drivers in higher-level
languages."
